---Response for detailed carbon emissions
---@class azure.carbon.CarbonEmissionItemDetailData
---@field dataType azure.carbon.CarbonEmissionItemDetailDataDataType The data type of the query result, indicating the format of the returned response.
---@field latestMonthEmissions number Total carbon emissions for the specified query parameters, measured in kgCO2E. This value represents total emissions over the specified date range (e.g., March-June).
---@field previousMonthEmissions number Total carbon emissions for the previous month’s date range, which is the same period as the specified date range but shifted left by one month (e.g., if the specified range is March - June, the previous month’s range will be Feb - May). The value is measured in kgCO2E.
---@field monthOverMonthEmissionsChangeRatio? number The percentage change in carbon emissions between the current and previous DateRange. This is calculated as: (latestMonthEmissions - previousMonthEmissions) / previousMonthEmissions.
---@field monthlyEmissionsChangeValue? number The change in carbon emissions between the current and previous period, calculated as: latestMonthEmissions - previousMonthEmissions.
---@field itemName string Item name, it can be resource name, resource type name, location, resource group name or subscriptionId. It depends on category type.
---@field categoryType azure.carbon.CategoryTypeEnum Item category, see supported type value defined in CategoryTypeEnum

